# HP50g ARMToolbox install through the original File Manager.
# Put real destination port 2. on the stack, select the actual SETUP.BIN
# on SD, execute the selected installer, warmstart, then verify library 275.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
# MODE/OK closes either the remaining boot confirmation or the modes form.
# Choose RPN explicitly below, after HOME has accepted the destination port.
5000 tap mode
6000 tap f6
6500 tap two
6800 tap period
7100 tap enter
7900 capture port-number
# CHOOS has Algebraic then RPN. Left-shift/DOWN selects the last choice
# from either initial mode; plain arrows wrap and +/- only toggles.
8200 tap mode
8700 tap f2
9200 chord lshift down
10200 tap f6
10700 tap f6
11200 capture rpn-ready
12000 chord lshift files
14200 capture files
14500 tap up
14800 tap f6
16500 capture sd
16800 tap enter
17100 tap down
17800 capture sd-setup
18200 tap f5
20000 capture setup-evaluated
21000 chord on f3
23000 capture warmstart
23500 chord rshift two
24700 capture lib
25100 tap f3
26400 capture port2
26800 tap f4
28100 capture armtoolbox
28500 finish-install
